        "original_id": "631845de-f072-5aa6-8f30-b60802eb139e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Tod of the Fens\n- People: Henry V of England, Prince Hal, Tod\n- Places: Boston, England\n- Topics: fifteenth-century setting, incognito disguise\n\nFacts:\n- Henry V of England was born on 9 August 1386 and died on 31 August 1422.\n- Henry V of England was King of England from 1413 until his death in 1422 at age 36.\n- Tod of the Fens is set in Boston, England, in the fifteenth century.\n- Tod of the Fens is a light-hearted adventure about Tod, a boy who lives with a band of men outside town.\n- Tod of the Fens features Prince Hal, heir to the throne, who disguises himself to move among the people incognito.",
